cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "N-Ways Addressing for Sierra Leone: a national compound address register on the Plus Code grid"
abstract: "An open address register for Sierra Leone: 1,359,282 compound codes, one for every compound, each a community or town name people already use and a short number that is unique in the whole country on its own, with the reference engine, the conformance vectors, a deployable registry server and the research paper describing the model."
